ef=\"#purchase-template\"><span class=\"btn__text\">Purchase Pillar</span></a></p>\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Pillar Landing Page', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'pillar-landing-page', '', '', '2016-06-10 16:21:39', '2016-06-10 16:21:39', '', 362, 'http://tommustester.wpengine.com/?page_id=904', 0, 'page', '', 0),
