(1697, 6, '2017-10-23 22:35:38', '2017-10-23 22:35:38', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" el_class=\".hero__slide {height: 55%;}\"][vc_column][pillar_slider slider_height=\"height-70\"][pillar_slider_content image=\"272\"]\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 30px\">Pay your tax and\r\n<strong>lets grow together!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 18px\">The board of internal revenue (BIR) is the apex\r\ngovernment agency charge with the responsibility\r\nof superintending internally generated revenue in Ondo state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 18px\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/pages/about-company/\"><span class=\"btn__text\">More Details</span></a></p>\r\n[/pillar_slider_content][pillar_slider_content image=\"272\"]\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 30px\">Pay your tax and\r\n<strong>lets grow together!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 18px\">The board of internal revenue (BIR) is the apex\r\ngovernment agency charge with the responsibility\r\nof superintending internally generated revenue in Ondo state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;font-size: 18px\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/pages/about-company/\"><span class=\"btn__text\">More Details</span></a></p>\r\n[/pillar_slider_content][/pillar_slider][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Services that makes the process easier<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Getting information for filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section--container\"></div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Folder-WithDocument\" title=\"Tax Types\"]Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Monitor-Analytics\" title=\"Tax Systems\"]Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Financial\" title=\"Tax Collection\"]<span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.</span>\r\n\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Libra-2\" title=\"Tax Legislation\"]<span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.</span>\r\n\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h5>A Modular Approach</h5>\r\nMinimum viable product sticky note affordances prototype parallax unicorn quantitative vs. qualitative affordances grok responsive integrate. Waterfall is so 2000 and late user story prototype personas piverate viral intuitive disrupt responsive earned media user centered design. Paradigm thought leader bootstrapping ideate workflow disrupt human-centered design venture capital viral viral food-truck pair programming entrepreneur.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][pillar_skill_bar_block layout=\"horizontal-thin\" icon=\"\" title=\"Startups\" amount=\"85\"][pillar_skill_bar_block layout=\"horizontal-thin\" icon=\"\" title=\"Startups\" amount=\"85\"][pillar_skill_bar_block layout=\"horizontal-thin\" icon=\"\" title=\"Startups\" amount=\"85\"][pill