umn_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Monitor-Analytics\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Systems\"]Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Financial\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Collection\"]<span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.</span>[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Libra-2\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Legislation\"]<span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.</span>[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--white\" css=\".vc_custom_1465405568262{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Our Partners<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem\">Getting information for filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section--container\"></div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][pillar_client pppage=\"4\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--dark\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h6>YOUR SITE, YOUR WAY</h6>\r\nResponsive intuitive user story engaging quantitative vs. qualitative SpaceTeam pitch deck co-working engaging pair programming fund integrate. Physical computing innovate pivot integrate fund disrupt latte driven.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h6>DEVELOPER FRIENDLY</h6>\r\nResponsive intuitive user story engaging quantitative vs. qualitative SpaceTeam pitch deck co-working engaging pair programming fund integrate. Physical computing innovate pivot integrate fund disrupt latte driven.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h6>MODULAR &amp; REUSABLE</h6>\r\nResponsive intuitive user story engaging quantitative vs. qualitative SpaceTeam pitch deck co-working engaging pair programming fund integrate. Physical computing innovate pivot integrate fund disrupt latte driven.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--primary\" css=\".vc_custom_1465405591932{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Interested in working with Pillar?</h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a class=\"btn btn--sm\" href=\"/pages/contact-map-iframe/\"><span class=\"btn__text\">LET\'S TALK TURKEY</span></a></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Agency', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '723-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-23 23:01:28', '2017-10-23 23:01:28', '', 723, 'http://www.ondoweb.ondostate.gov.ng/bir/2017/10/23/723-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
