(2369, 6, '2017-10-26 12:00:54', '2017-10-26 12:00:54', '[vc_row parallax=\"content-moving\" parallax_image=\"2224\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 50px\">About Us</h3>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"section--overlap\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 50px;font-weight: 300;text-align: center\">Brief Information About Us</h2>\r\n.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"6/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1470146937754{padding-top: 200px !important;}\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">What BIR</h3>\r\nOndo state is located in the tropical forest of South western part of Nigeria, bounded in the north by Ekiti and Kogi states, in the east by Edo state, in the west by Osun and Ogun states and in the south by the Atlantic Ocean.\r\n\r\nThe states which has a fairly considerable population(put at about 3.44 million in 2006) possesses what it takes to be a haven of rewarding commercial activities and an economy backbone of the nation. Ondo state is richly blessed with copious natural resources waiting to be tapped. The strategic location of the state coupled with its peaceful and safe environment makes it very attractive to investors. Key areas of investment in the state are mineral resources exploration, agriculture and agro processing, tourism and infrastructure.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--secondary\"][vc_column][pillar_team][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--secondary\"][vc_column width=\"5/12\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3>\"Your Child, Our Future\". Innovation through education.</h3>\r\nPillar is a remarkably flexible and feature-complete HTML template built for modern startups, creatives, bloggers and more. Including tons of uniquely styled pages, Pillar combines aesthetic beauty with high-quality, semantic markup.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/12\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"6/12\"][pillar_video_inline