(2455, 1, '2017-10-27 15:41:34', '2017-10-27 15:41:34', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" el_class=\".hero__slide {height: 55%;}\"][vc_column][pillar_slider slider_height=\"height-70\"][pillar_slider_content image=\"2123\"]\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">Pay your tax and\r\n<strong>lets grow together!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;\">The board of internal revenue (BIR) is the apex\r\ngovernment agency charge with the responsibility\r\nof superintending internally generated revenue in Ondo state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;\"><a class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #f48148;\" href=\"http://www.ondoweb.ondostate.gov.ng/bir/contact-us\"><span class=\"btn__text\">More Details</span></a></p>\r\n[/pillar_slider_content][pillar_slider_content image=\"2127\"]\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 30px;\">Pay your tax and\r\n<strong>lets grow together!!!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;\">The board of internal revenue (BIR) is the apex\r\ngovernment agency charge with the responsibility\r\nof superintending internally generated revenue in Ondo state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;\"><a class=\"btn\" style=\"background-color: #f48148;\" href=\"/pages/about-company/\"><span class=\"btn__text\">More Details</span></a></p>\r\n[/pillar_slider_content][/pillar_slider][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center;\">Services that makes the process easier<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Getting information for filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Folder-WithDocument\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Types\"]Tax Collection is the implementation of the measures (Tax Policies and Tax Laws) put in place by a statutory government institution for the purpose of generating and aggregating revenue for the Government.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Monitor-Analytics\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Systems\"]The Nigerian tax is lopsided and dominated majorly by oil revenue and imports, therefore the establishment of effective and efficient tax systems faces some formidable challenges.  Nigeria can use its new tax regime as a tool.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Financial\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Collection\"]To enable a transparent, innovative and convenience method of tax collection to help avoid multiple taxation of citizens and organizations, various methods has been introduced to aid this process via our various outlets.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Libra-2\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Legislation\"]The importance of taxation in any economy cannot be overemphasized, and its effects remain significant. It helps greatly in the redistribution of income and gives the government funds that it can use to finance public services.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--primary\" css=\".vc_custom_1508801036018{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-right: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;padding-left: 10px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Interested in taking a Self Assessment?</h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn--sm\" href=\"/pages/contact-map-iframe/\"><span class=\"btn__text\">CLICK HERE</span></a></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Add-Basket\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Pay Tax\"]Feel free to call us on\r\n<strong>0 (700) 225-55477</strong>\r\nMonday - Friday, 8am - 7pm[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Mail-withAtSign\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Contact Us\"]Feel free to call us on\r\n<strong>0 (700) 225-55477</strong>\r\nMonday - Friday, 8am - 7pm[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Map-Marker2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Our Address\"]Drop us a line anytime at\r\n<strong><a href=\"mailto:info@ondobirs.gov.ng\">info@ondobir.gov.ng,</a></strong>\r\nand we\'ll get back soon.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][pillar_text_image layout=\"boxed\" image=\"2151\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Post-Sign\" layout=\"large\" alignment=\"text-center\"]\r\n<h4 style=\"font-weight: 300;\"><a href=\"#\">Find our Tax Stations</a>\r\nAround Ondo</h4>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/pillar_text_image][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][pillar_text_image layout=\"boxed\" image=\"2181\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Letter-Open\" layout=\"large\" alignment=\"text-center\"]\r\n<h4 style=\"font-weight: 300;\"><a href=\"#\">Interesting Updates on</a>\r\nRevenue in Ondo</h4>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/pillar_text_image][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--white\" css=\".vc_custom_1465405568262{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Partners<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Getting information for filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section--container\"></div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"3/4\"][pillar_client pppage=\"3\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Agency', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '723-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-27 15:41:34', '2017-10-27 15:41:34', '', 723, 'http://www.ondoweb.ondostate.gov.ng/bir/2017/10/27/723-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(2458, 1, '2017-10-27 15:55:57', '2017-10-27 15:55:57', '[vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\"][vc_column][vc_gmaps link=\"#E-8_\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"section--overlap\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Map-Marker2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" title=\"Drop on in\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Akure express/Akure\r\nAlagbaka quarters, Akure\r\nOndo State</p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Phone-2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" title=\"Give us a call\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Speak to Us\r\nOffice: +2348033880944</p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Computer\" layout=\"boxed-large\" title=\"Connect Online\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Email: <a href=\"#\">ondostaterevenue@gmail.com</a>\r\nTwitter: <a href=\"#\">@ondorevenue</a></p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text]\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Or reach us right here…</h4>\r\n[/vc_column_text][contact-form-7 id=\"1003\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Contact Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '157-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-27 15:55:57', '2017-10-27 15:55:57', '', 157, 'http://www.ondoweb.ondostate.gov.ng/bir/2017/10/27/157-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
