\" alignment=\"text-center\"]\r\n<h4 style=\"font-weight: 300; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://www.odbir.com/gallery/\">Recent Updates</a></h4>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/pillar_text_image][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css_animation=\"rollIn\" el_class=\"bg--primary\" css=\".vc_custom_1522303830040{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-right: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 20px !important;padding-left: 10px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Want to find out all about the revenues we collect?</h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn--sm\" style=\"border: 2px solid white;\" href=\"/igr\"><span class=\"btn__text\">CLICK HERE</span></a></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center;\">Services that make the process easier<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Folder-WithDocument\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Types\"]Determines the different types of tax collected by the different taxation bodies. Makes clear the outlines used by different taxation bodies for the various types of tax.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Monitor-Analytics\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Systems\"]The Nigerian tax is lopsided and dominated majorly by oil revenue and imports, therefore the establishment of effective and efficient tax systems faces some formidable challenges. Nigeria can use its tax system as a tool.[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Financial\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Collection\"]To enable a transparent, innovative and convenience method of tax collection to help avoid multiple taxation of citizens and organizations, various methods has been introduced.\r\n\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/4\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Libra-2\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Legislation\"]The importance of taxation in any economy cannot be overemphasized, and its effects remain significant. It helps greatly in the redistribution of income and gives the government funds.\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Phone-2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Give us a call\"]+2348188397000\r\n+2349028477004\r\n+2348104864804 (Whatsapp only)[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Mail-withAtSign\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Contact Us\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>contactus@odbir.com</b>\r\n<b>info@odbir.com</b>\r\n<b>chairman@odbir.com</b></p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Map-Marker2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Visit us\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ondo State Board of Internal Revenue,\r\nAlagbaka, Ondo State.</p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--white\" css=\".vc_custom_1465405568262{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Partners<em>.</em></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Getting information for filing your taxes just got easier</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section--container\"></div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner][pillar_client pppage=\"3\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'ODBIR Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '723-revision-v1', '', '', '2018-03-29 14:03:44', '2018-03-29 14:03:44', '', 723, 'http://www.odbir.com/723-re