n=\"icon-Libra-2\" layout=\"boxed\" title=\"Tax Legislation\"]The importance of taxation in any economy cannot be overemphasized, and its effects remain significant. It helps greatly in the redistribution of income and gives the government funds.\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row 0=\"\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Phone-2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Give us a call\"]+2348188397000\r\n+2349028477004\r\n+2348104864804 (Whatsapp only)[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Mail-withAtSign\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Contact Us\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>contactus@odbir.com</b>\r\n<b>info@odbir.com</b>\r\n<b>chairman@odbir.com</b></p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][pillar_icon_box icon=\"icon-Map-Marker2\" layout=\"boxed-large\" alignment=\"text-center\" title=\"Visit us\"]\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ondo State Board of Internal Revenue,\r\nAlagbaka, Ondo State.</p>\r\n[/pillar_icon_box][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row el_class=\"bg--white\" css=\".vc_custom_1465405568262{padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}\"][vc_column 0=\"\"][vc_column_text 0=\"\"]\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Partners</h3>\r\n<div class=\"section--container\"></div>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner 0=\"\"][vc_column_inner 0=\"\"][pillar_client pppage=\"3\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'ODBIR Homepage', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '723-revision-v1', '', '', '2018-07-24 23:48:54', '2018-07-24 23:48:54', '', 723, 'http://www.irs.on.gov.ng/723-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
